OL,3,GNEWSAHow city became home of drum and
OL,4,Abass and jungle
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt all started in the early 90s, with a
OL,7,FDJ collective called Full Cycle. They
OL,8,Fwere influenced by Jamaican sound
OL,9,Fsystems, acid house and hip hop, which
OL,10,Fled to a new sound explosion in the
OL,11,Fcity.
